title: Seesaw
text: A quantum TANGLER splits a beam into twins that fly off in opposite directions. When one twin passes through a DOPPLER, the other twin changes colour too, at the same moment, but the opposite way.
trick: the doppler on one twin recolours the other twin from the matching distance on
motif: seesaw: a post with a plank balanced on top
